    {
      "en": " The ijma of the\nintellectuals and the prominent companions of Medina is a flagrant lie.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\nBased on your own sources, I will give you a list of names of some of those who opposed the caliphate.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\nIbn Hajar Asqalani and Baladhuri, each in his Ta'rikh, Muhammad Ibn Khawind Shah in his Rauzatu's-\nSafa, Ibn Abdu'l-Birr in his Isti'ab, and others say that Sa'd Ibn Ubaida and a part of Khazrajis and a\ngroup of Quraish did not swear the oath of fealty to Abu Bakr.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": "\nMoreover, eighteen people who were prominent and distinguished companions of the Holy Prophet did\nnot take the oath of allegiance to Abu Bakr.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " They were Shi’as of ‘Ali Ibn Abu Talib.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " The names of those\neighteen people are as follows:\n1.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Salman al-Farsi\n2.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
      "en": " Abu Dharr Ghifari\n3.",
      "ur": null,
      "fa": null,
      "ar": null
    },
    {
